# Single-repo C — X-macro expansion membership
#
# Coverage target: preprocessor-generated command table. The answer
# must enumerate the five commands from cmds.def and explain the
# double-expansion pattern in dispatch.c.
ID="sr_c_xmacro_table"
NAME="c xmacro — command table membership"
FIXTURE="eval/fixtures/c-macro-platform"
QUESTION="这个程序支持哪些命令？命令表是怎么从 cmds.def 生成出来的？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="ping echo stat sleep quit cmds.def"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(ping).*(echo).*(stat).*(sleep).*(quit)|(5|五).*(命令|command)
(CMD|宏|macro|X-macro|展开|expand).*(cmds\\.def|dispatch)|(cmds\\.def).*(CMD|宏|macro|展开|expand)
(两次|twice|两遍|声明|declar).*(展开|expand|table|表)|(展开|expand).*(两次|twice|声明|declar|table|表)"
